(text "U1 pad numbering: LEFT 1..24 and RIGHT 25..48, top to bottom viewed from above; USB at top." (at 15 251 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid ba9aa35b-6ca4-5726-9b18-97206fa9ef40))
(text "External modules not integrated. J6 carries LOGIC, never attach CANH/CANL here. J7 is a custom harness." (at 15 257 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid 82da724c-00c9-5a8d-8dcc-372878b024f9))
(text "No direct oil/coolant ADC conditioning in Rev A. Optional modules must be 3.3V logic." (at 15 263 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid 3ab3fbfb-bfc2-5447-acf3-de6834007cfe))
(text "Do not independently USB-power GPS while attached; it can backfeed its supply or UART." (at 15 269 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left)) (uuid 0feb24aa-e15a-5278-a298-765ae437a28f))
